  "translation": "Today is weekend, I went to the supermarket with my friend. We first arrived at the fruit area. Inside there are many fruits, such as apples and bananas. My friend asked me: 'What fruit will you buy?' I said: 'I want to buy a few oranges.' Then we walked to the drink area. I saw many kinds of drinks, including milk, juice, and water. My friend said: 'I like milk the most, can you help me get a cup?' I replied: 'Of course.' Then we went to the snack area, where there are cookies and chocolate. My friend said: 'Let's buy a piece of chocolate.' I agreed. Finally we walked to the front of the cashier counter to pay. The cashier said: 'Total is fifty yuan.' I paid the money, and then we all went home."
